OCPROJECT 1
# Engine test content for PLACING A GRAPH CLASS from the editor (docs/plans/parity_demo/PLACE_CLASS.md).
# Not a demo game: Sandbox.exe --project test-content/ClassPlace/Game.ocproject --class-place-test
# opens it, places and deletes and undoes class actors, saves, and exits 0 when every check passes.
#
# The two version stamps are the full engine version (0.6.0-1). A project made by an older series raises an
# upgrade prompt at open, and a frame-limited run has nobody to answer it.
NAME ClassPlace
ENGINE Aver 0.6.0-1
CREATEDWITH 0.6.0-1
CONTENT Content
STARTMAP Maps/ClassPlace.ocworld
